  "body": "Compare part 2.2 here with the existing part 2.2 definition at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#valid-floating-point-number, which is distractingly odd in that the number for the first substep there is on the same line as the step number:\n\n> [**ODD**] <img width=\"455\" alt=\"odd definition of valid floating-point number showing its constituent parts\" src=\"https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/194984/9928882/167d03d4-5d64-11e5-9aab-d5b13452ba04.png\">\n\nvs\n\n> [**GOOD**] <img width=\"440\" alt=\"good definition of valid floating-point number showing its constituent parts\" src=\"https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/194984/9929018/0acd7e1e-5d65-11e5-84e2-45c187dc8f58.png\">\n",
